The Mediator/Arbitrator Selection Agent assists in constituting the mediation panel or nominating a qualified neutral for a specific dispute. It references pre-approved empanelment lists, qualifications, experience records, and domain expertise to shortlist suitable mediators or arbitrators for the case. This ensures that every appointment is transparent, compliant with institutional or IBBI mediation rules, and suited to the dispute’s subject matter.";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:5:{s:4:"date";a:2:{s:7:"created";i:1761648267;s:8:"modified";i:1761648291;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Atul Grover";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1761648291;s:2:"ip";s:13:"49.43.109.130";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:78:"digital_agents:mediation_agents:mediator_constitution:mediator_selection_agent";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:0:"";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:40;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}s:11:"contributor";a:1:{s:5:"admin";s:11:"Atul Grover";}}}